{"4367310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sugar Orbit", "steam_appid": 4367310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sugar Orbit</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A planet-hopping platformer</strong> where you control a bouncy gummibear on a mission to <strong>rescue lost gummies</strong> scattered across the galaxy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367310/extras/e516ba09e318f5fbaed71ff525ddbe2b.poster.avif?t=1782816094\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367310/extras/e516ba09e318f5fbaed71ff525ddbe2b.webm?t=1782816094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367310/extras/e516ba09e318f5fbaed71ff525ddbe2b.mp4?t=1782816094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Chapter is a compact challenge built around <strong>momentum-based jumping</strong>, <strong>gravity shifts</strong>, and <strong>precise movement</strong>. You can take your time, learn the physics, and explore each world at your own pace, or push yourself to move faster and cleaner with every attempt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to welcome new players while rewarding mastery. Quick restarts, clear level layouts, and built-in timers encourage experimentation, optimization, and perfect runs without forcing speed on anyone. Whether you’re <strong>playing casually or hunting for better times</strong>, every jump matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue all the gummies, discover faster routes, and decide how you want to play. Slow and careful or fast and optimized, the galaxy is yours to bounce through.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sugar Orbit</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A planet-hopping platformer</strong> where you control a bouncy gummibear on a mission to <strong>rescue lost gummies</strong> scattered across the galaxy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367310/extras/e516ba09e318f5fbaed71ff525ddbe2b.poster.avif?t=1782816094\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367310/extras/e516ba09e318f5fbaed71ff525ddbe2b.webm?t=1782816094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4367310/extras/e516ba09e318f5fbaed71ff525ddbe2b.mp4?t=1782816094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Chapter is a compact challenge built around <strong>momentum-based jumping</strong>, <strong>gravity shifts</strong>, and <strong>precise movement</strong>. You can take your time, learn the physics, and explore each world at your own pace, or push yourself to move faster and cleaner with every attempt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to welcome new players while rewarding mastery. Quick restarts, clear level layouts, and built-in timers encourage experimentation, optimization, and perfect runs without forcing speed on anyone. Whether you’re <strong>playing casually or hunting for better times</strong>, every jump matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue all the gummies, discover faster routes, and decide how you want to play. Slow and careful or fast and optimized, the galaxy is yours to bounce through.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A platformer where you play a gummibear jumping between planets to 